  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252femissive-glowing-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/emissive-glowing-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p><p><strong>发光矿石材质包</strong>为主世界和下界矿石添加发光纹理。需要安装OptiFine、Continuity或其他支持自发光材质的模组，否则不会产生任何变化。</p><p>使以下方块具有自发光效果：</p><ul>\n<li>铁矿石</li>\n<li>煤矿石</li>\n<li>红石矿石</li>\n<li>绿宝石矿石</li>\n<li>钻石矿石</li>\n<li>青金石矿石</li>\n<li>金矿石</li>\n<li>铜矿石</li>\n<li>远古残骸</li>\n<li>镶金黑石</li>\n<li>下界石英矿石</li>\n<li>下界金矿石</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8f57345b-7d7e-4495-85d1-769ec501a0e8.webp\" alt=\"洞穴中的发光矿石\"></p>",
